  "question": {
    "text": "If the variance of the frequency distribution\n$\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\n\\hline x & c & 2 c & 3 c & 4 c & 5 c & 6 c \\\\\n\\hline f & 2 & 1 & 1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}$\nis 160, then the value of $c \\in N$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
